\xymatrix{
u_2 \circ v_1 \ar[r]_\beta \ar[d]_{\beta^\vee} &
u_1 \circ v_1 \ar[d] \\
u_2 \circ v_2 \ar[r] & \text{id}
}
$$
is commutative where the unlabeled arrows are the counit transformations.

